{"seq":2,"slug":"numeric-range-bucket","title":"数值/价格区间与桶策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/faceted-navigation-aggregation/facet-model/numeric-range-bucket","wordCount":1967,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"数值-价格区间与桶策略\">数值/价格区间与桶策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>价格是结果页上使用率最高的筛选维度之一，但它在数据模型里是最难处理的那种：它是一个连续量，取值集合无限，且几乎每个商品的价格都不同。用户不可能从「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.47</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.47 /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.47/</span></span></span></span></span>3.48 / $3.49 …」里挑，所以必须把它切成区间。切法只有四种基本思路，每一种都有自己的失败场景，而选择哪种取决于数据的分布形状和用户的心智模型。</p>\n<p>四种切法分别是：等宽（每个桶跨度相同）、等频（每个桶装同样数量的商品）、对数等宽（跨度按倍数增长）、业务固定（由运营直接指定边界）。它们在同一个价格分布上会给出截然不同的桶，而只有一种会让用户觉得「这些选项有意义」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  D[价格分布] --&gt; Q{分布形状}&#10;  Q --&gt;|近似均匀| EW[等宽切桶&lt;br/&gt;0-100/100-200/...]&#10;  Q --&gt;|长尾集中| EQ[等频切桶&lt;br/&gt;每桶约等量商品]&#10;  Q --&gt;|跨数量级| LOG[对数切桶&lt;br/&gt;0-50/50-100/100-200/...]&#10;  Q --&gt;|业务有锚点| FIX[业务固定桶&lt;br/&gt;运营指定边界]&#10;  EW --&gt; C[校验: 空桶率 / 计数偏斜]&#10;  EQ --&gt; C&#10;  LOG --&gt; C&#10;  FIX --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|不满足| Q\">graph TD\n  D[价格分布] --&gt; Q{分布形状}\n  Q --&gt;|近似均匀| EW[等宽切桶&lt;br/&gt;0-100/100-200/...]\n  Q --&gt;|长尾集中| EQ[等频切桶&lt;br/&gt;每桶约等量商品]\n  Q --&gt;|跨数量级| LOG[对数切桶&lt;br/&gt;0-50/50-100/100-200/...]\n  Q --&gt;|业务有锚点| FIX[业务固定桶&lt;br/&gt;运营指定边界]\n  EW --&gt; C[校验: 空桶率 / 计数偏斜]\n  EQ --&gt; C\n  LOG --&gt; C\n  FIX --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|不满足| Q</pre><p>这张图的回流边是有意的：桶策略不是一次性的决策，而是随数据分布漂移需要复核的对象。价格带会随通货膨胀与品类结构变化整体上移，两年前合理的等宽边界今天就可能把 80% 商品压进第一个桶。所以桶定义需要被监控，指标见 <a href=\"../facet-serving-ops/facet-quality-monitor\">分面覆盖率/零值/性能监控</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>边界规则</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>失败场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等宽</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = w_{i-1} + \\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>易理解、稳定</td>\n<td>长尾分布下首桶占绝大多数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等频</td>\n<td>每桶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx N/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个商品</td>\n<td>桶间可比</td>\n<td>分布变化时边界频繁漂移，不可缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对数等宽</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = w_{i-1} \\cdot r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6528em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>跨数量级仍可读</td>\n<td>低端桶过密，高端桶跨度过大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务固定</td>\n<td>人工给定</td>\n<td>贴合用户心理价位</td>\n<td>品类扩张后边界复用不当</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"等宽与等频的取舍\">等宽与等频的取舍</h2><h3 id=\"边界稳定性与分布自适应性\">边界稳定性与分布自适应性</h3><p>等宽切桶的计算简单到极点：给定上下界与桶数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个桶是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[L + i \\cdot \\Delta, L + (i+1) \\cdot \\Delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = (U - L)/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。它的核心优势是<strong>边界稳定</strong>——除非有人显式改配置，桶不变。稳定意味着可缓存、可埋点对比、可做跨品类的一致性展示。</p>\n<p>等宽的失败点在真实电商数据上非常确定。价格分布几乎总是右偏长尾：大量商品集中在低价带，少数高价商品把上界拉得很高。如果按商品的实际最大值设上界并均匀切分，前端会看到「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>200</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>184</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>203</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0-200 (184,203) /</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">184</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">203</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span></span></span></span></span>200-400 (12,442) / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>600</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>110</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>…</mo><mtext>」，首桶占九成，用户看不出任何结构。解决办法通常不是换策略，而是</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>先截断上界</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mtext>：用分位数（比如</mtext><mi>P</mi><mn>99</mn><mtext>）作为上界，超出部分合并进「</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400-600 (3,110) …」，首桶占九成，用户看不出任何结构。解决办法通常不是换策略，而是**先截断上界**：用分位数（比如 P99）作为上界，超出部分合并进「</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">110</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">」，首桶占九成，用户看不出任何结构。解决办法通常不是换策略，而是</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">先截断上界</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：用分位数（比如</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">99</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）作为上界，超出部分合并进「</span></span></span></span></span>1000+」这种兜底桶。这保留了等宽的稳定性，同时避免了长尾把边界拉散。</p>\n<p>等频切桶反过来：它先看数据分布，让每个区间装大致相同数量的商品。这样每个桶的数字量级接近，用户在桶之间做比较时有信息量。代价是边界会随数据漂移——同一份配置在上个月和这个月生成的边界不同，因此聚合结果不能按固定桶键缓存，桶键本身也变成了不稳定标识，破坏了 <a href=\"facet-dimension-schema\">分面维度与属性 schema</a> 里「桶 key 是对外契约」的原则。</p>\n<p>实际系统里常见的折中是「离线用等频算出边界，再固化成业务固定桶」：等频只作为一次分析手段，产出的边界经人工确认后写进配置，从此以固定桶运行。这样既得到了合理的桶分布，又保住了稳定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对数切桶与跨数量级分布\">对数切桶与跨数量级分布</h2><h3 id=\"显式边界优于查询期公式\">显式边界优于查询期公式</h3><p>当同一份数据跨越多个数量级时，等宽与等频都不好用。软件订阅价格从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext>到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">到</span></span></span></span></span>10/月，企业方案到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>年；房产价格从几十万到几千万。这种情况下用户的感知是对数的——</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10,000/年；房产价格从几十万到几千万。这种情况下用户的感知是对数的——</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年；房产价格从几十万到几千万。这种情况下用户的感知是对数的</span><span class=\"mord\">——</span></span></span></span></span>10 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>的差别比</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20 的差别比</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的差别比</span></span></span></span></span>1000 到 $1010 大得多。对数等宽切桶直接把这个感知写进边界：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>U</mi><mi>L</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i = [\\,L \\cdot r^{\\,i},\\; L \\cdot r^{\\,i+1}\\,), \\quad r = \\left(\\frac{U}{L}\\right)^{1/k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0691em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1247em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6779em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = 10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>，桶为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>100</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10000</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>10000</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100000</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[10,100), [100,1000), [1000,10000), [10000,100000)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100000</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——每个桶跨一个数量级。这个形式的优点是跨品类可复用，缺点是低端过密、高端过疏：如果大部分商品在 $50 以下，四个桶里有三个是空的。</p>\n<p>因此对数切桶几乎总是与「低端加密」混合使用：在主要分布区间用等宽，向两端各接一个开口桶。落到配置上就是显式枚举边界，而不是用公式在查询期计算——显式边界可以被缓存、可以被运营修改，公式不能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;attribute&quot;: &quot;price&quot;,&#10;  &quot;currency_aware&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;buckets&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;p_0_50&quot;, &quot;from&quot;: 0, &quot;to&quot;: 50, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;≤ $50&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;p_50_100&quot;, &quot;from&quot;: 50, &quot;to&quot;: 100, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;$50 – $100&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;p_100_200&quot;, &quot;from&quot;: 100, &quot;to&quot;: 200, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;$100 – $200&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;p_200_500&quot;, &quot;from&quot;: 200, &quot;to&quot;: 500, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;$200 – $500&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;p_500_plus&quot;, &quot;from&quot;: 500, &quot;to&quot;: null, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;$500+&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;fallback_bucket&quot;: &quot;p_500_plus&quot;,&#10;  &quot;recompute_hint&quot;: &quot;quarterly&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"attribute\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency_aware\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"buckets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_0_50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"≤ $50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_50_100\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$50 – $100\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_100_200\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$100 – $200\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_200_500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$200 – $500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_500_plus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$500+\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fallback_bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_500_plus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"recompute_hint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quarterly\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>to: null</code> 表示开口桶，它兜住所有超出人工边界的值。没有兜底桶是价格分面最常见的缺陷之一：用户设定了上界，所有超过上界的商品就全部从分面里消失，计数之和小于结果总数，看起来像数据缺失。<code>recompute_hint</code> 不是给引擎读的，而是给运营流程读的——它声明这个桶定义应当在什么周期被复核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"币种-税与展示价的一致性\">币种、税与展示价的一致性</h2><h3 id=\"口径一致性是硬要求\">口径一致性是硬要求</h3><p>跨境场景给数值维度加了一层维度：同一个商品在不同站点有不同的展示价，而分面桶必须与用户看到的货币一致。如果索引里只存一个基准币种的价格，那么在做多站点分面时会出现「分面桶是美元区间、商品卡片显示当地货币」的错位，用户点进 $50–100 却发现全是 ¥700 左右的商品。</p>\n<p>处理方式有两种。第一种是索引里按站点物化多份价格列（<code>price_usd</code>、<code>price_jpy</code>…），分面查询时按站点选列，代价是索引膨胀与汇率更新时的重索引。第二种是索引只存基准价，在查询期把桶边界按汇率换算成基准价区间，代价是汇率变动会让缓存的聚合结果失效，且边界换算后不再是整数，展示时要做取整并承担微小偏差。</p>\n<p>两种都能用，判断依据是站点数量与价格波动频率：站点少且汇率稳定时前者更简单；站点多且需要频繁调价时后者运维成本更低。无论选哪种，<strong>口径一致性</strong>是硬要求——分面桶里的商品与结果列表里的商品必须用同一个价格字段、同一套汇率、同一个时点。只要有一处不一致，就会出现「桶里说有 12 件，点进去只有 10 件」这类最难查的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>连续量必须切桶才能成为分面，四种基本切法各有明确的失败场景，没有普适最优解。</li>\n<li>等宽的优势是边界稳定因此可缓存；它需要先把上界截断到分位数，否则长尾会把首桶压成九成。</li>\n<li>等频让桶间可比，但边界随数据漂移，会破坏桶 key 的对外契约性，通常只作为离线分析手段。</li>\n<li>对数切桶贴合跨数量级的感知，实践中几乎总是与低端加密、两端开口混合使用。</li>\n<li>桶定义应当显式枚举并落到配置，而不是在查询期用公式计算，这样才能被缓存、被运营修改、被监控。</li>\n<li>兜底开口桶不可省略；跨境场景下分面桶、结果列表、商品卡片必须共用同一套币种与汇率口径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数值/价格区间与桶策略","id":"数值-价格区间与桶策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"等宽与等频的取舍","id":"等宽与等频的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"边界稳定性与分布自适应性","id":"边界稳定性与分布自适应性"},{"level":2,"text":"对数切桶与跨数量级分布","id":"对数切桶与跨数量级分布"},{"level":3,"text":"显式边界优于查询期公式","id":"显式边界优于查询期公式"},{"level":2,"text":"币种、税与展示价的一致性","id":"币种-税与展示价的一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"口径一致性是硬要求","id":"口径一致性是硬要求"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分面维度与属性 schema","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/faceted-navigation-aggregation/facet-model/facet-dimension-schema"},"next":{"title":"层级类目分面与归并","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/faceted-navigation-aggregation/facet-model/hierarchical-category-facet"}}